cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this database or its curation output, please cite it as below."
title: "CAR-T / T-cell Multi-omics Database (TCMDB)"
abstract: >-
  A curated, bilingual index of public CAR-T and T-cell multi-omics datasets from NCBI GEO,
  organised by disease category, with verifiable omics types, sample counts, integrity status
  and literature links. Includes a batch download-script generator that only emits commands
  for download URLs verified against official GEO/SRA metadata.
type: software
license: MIT
